### Load the whole patrol route
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patrol
Accept: application/json

### Add a checkpoint behind the current one
POST http://localhost:8080/api/checkpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Charging Station",
  "description": "Check battery level",
  "priority": "NORMAL"
}

### Move the robot forward
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patrol/next
Accept: application/json

### Move the robot backward
POST http://localhost:8080/api/patrol/previous
Accept: application/json

### Remove the current checkpoint
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/checkpoints/current
Accept: application/json

### Invalid request, must answer 400 and never 500
POST http://localhost:8080/api/checkpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "  ",
  "description": "Check battery level",
  "priority": "URGENT"
}

### CORS preflight from the delivered frontend
OPTIONS http://localhost:8080/api/checkpoints
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST
